scope.text:
1.1 This standard covers the requirements for solid round glass fibre reinforced polymer (GFRP) straight bars, provided in cut lengths or coils, and bent bars or stirrups; and having an external surface enhancement for use as concrete reinforcement.
1.2 The following GFRP materials are not covered by this standard:
a) Bars made of more than one load-bearing fibre types (that is, hybrid FRP);
b) Bars having no external surface enhancement (that is, plain or smooth bars, or dowels);
c) Bars with geometries other than solid, round cross-sections;
d) Bars with even traces of polyester in the base polymer/resin; and
e) Couplers and bars connected with couplers.
1.3 IS 18255 is a necessary adjunct to this standard.

